      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is Ekdotico α. α (alpha) is the first release of Ekdotico, made for a small group of people to try. This document teaches the editor, and it is also an example of it: each block you read here is a block you can change. The document belongs to your account, so you can edit it, rename it, or delete it."
